{
  "_comment": "Example roster. Copy to agents.json and fill in real hosts. Each agent: name, host (user@host or 'local'), platform, hermes_home, enabled, role. Optional 'python' pins an interpreter when the box has no usable python on PATH. Set enabled:false with a blocked_reason to keep an unreachable machine visible instead of forgotten.",
  "agents": [
